# Half of the wizard's pair. GMS runs it over 20 levels at 99+5x; here it is
# the same climb in half the steps, ending where GMS ends.
#
# The ice half of the pair, and it leaves two things behind: Freeze Stacks on
# the character, and eight seconds of freezing on what it hit. GMS states both.
# The stacks say how much Freezing Crush and Shatter are worth; the freezing
# says whether they are collected at all, and Storm Magic asks for nothing
# else. Between them they are the whole reason to cast the weaker of the two.
